.env

# --- credentials -----------------------------------------------------------
# `.env` alone was not enough: a file named `env` (no dot) is a different path
# and has already shown up untracked with a live Parallel key in it. Cover the
# whole family, and the shapes a cloud credential arrives in.
env
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*-key.json
*.pem
*.p12
gha-creds-*.json

# --- local run artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Debug snapshots of production state, taken while diagnosing a live run.
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.bak-*
